What the C actually is: an amalgamated copy of [38;5;10mstb_ds.h[0m (dynamic arrays + open-addressed hash maps with 8-slot buckets) plus the [38;5;10msh_geti[0m string-hashmap exerciser, which is the only symbol declared in [38;5;10minclude/lib.h[0m. There are no namespace-renaming macros, so the 16 linker symbols are unprefixed; the Rust exports the same 16 names.[0m[0m
